# A payment method

> type /methods
NEW MESSAGE
💳 Payment methods (0)
  None yet. Add the cards and accounts that pay your subscriptions.
  [➕ Add a payment method](a|pmn)
  [🏠 Home](a|home)

> press Add a payment method
(toast: Type your answer)
NEW MESSAGE
💳 New payment method
  Type its name, e.g. Revolut or Visa ••4421.

> type Visa ••4421
NEW MESSAGE
💳 Visa ••4421
  What is it?
  [💳 Card](a|pmk|card) [🏦 Bank account](a|pmk|bank)
  [PayPal](a|pmk|paypal) [Something else](a|pmk|other)

> press Card
(toast: Added 💳)
💳 Visa ••4421
  Card
  No subscription uses it.
  [✏️ Name](a|pme|pm_X|name) [🔢 Last 4 digits](a|pme|pm_X|last4)
  [📅 Expiry](a|pme|pm_X|exp) [🗑 Delete](a|pmd|pm_X)
  [‹ Payment methods](a|pms) [🏠 Home](a|home)

> press Expiry
(toast: Type your answer)
NEW MESSAGE
💳 Edit payment method
  Type when it expires, e.g. 08/27.

> type 12/26
NEW MESSAGE
💳 Visa ••4421
  Card
  Expires 12/26
  No subscription uses it.
  [✏️ Name](a|pme|pm_X|name) [🔢 Last 4 digits](a|pme|pm_X|last4)
  [📅 Expiry](a|pme|pm_X|exp) [🗑 Delete](a|pmd|pm_X)
  [‹ Payment methods](a|pms) [🏠 Home](a|home)

# A subscription, step by step

> type /add
(toast: Type its name)
NEW MESSAGE
➕ New subscription
  What is it called? Type the name, e.g. Netflix.

> type Netflix
NEW MESSAGE
➕ Netflix
  How much is each charge? Type it like 12.99, or 12.99 USD for another currency.

> type 13,99
NEW MESSAGE
➕ Netflix
  How often is it charged?
  [Every month](a|af|month|1) [Every year](a|af|year|1)
  [Every week](a|af|week|1) [Every 3 months](a|af|month|3)
  [Every 6 months](a|af|month|6) [Every 2 years](a|af|year|2)
  [✖ Discard](a|ax)

> press Every month
➕ Netflix
  When is the next charge? Pick the day, or type a date.
