# The bank took more than expected
❓ Was Netflix charged?
  💶 €13.99 · Thu, 12 Nov 2026
  💳 Visa ••4421
  🏷 Streaming
  ⏰ Cancel by Tue, 13 Oct 2026
  [✅ Paid](paid|chg_X) [⏳ Not yet](notyet|chg_X) [❌ Failed](failed|chg_X)
  [📅 New date](date|chg_X|2026-11) [⏭ Skip](skip|chg_X)
  [💶 Paid, another amount](pa|chg_X)

> press Paid, another amount
(toast: Type the amount)
NEW MESSAGE
💶 How much did Netflix take?
  Expected €13.99. Type the amount, e.g. 13.99, or with another currency: 11.20 EUR.

> type 15.99
NEW MESSAGE
✅ Netflix paid
  💶 €13.99 · Thu, 12 Nov 2026
  💳 Visa ••4421
  🏷 Streaming
  🏦 charged €15.99
  ## New price?
  It took €15.99 instead of €13.99 (+14.3%, +€24.00 a year).
  [Yes, from now on](np|chg_X|15.99) [Just this time](back|chg_X)
  [↩︎ Reopen](reopen|chg_X)
  [↩︎ Undo](undo|chg_X|aud_X)

> press Yes, from now on
(toast: Price updated 💶)
✅ Netflix paid
  💶 €13.99 · Thu, 12 Nov 2026
  💳 Visa ••4421
  🏷 Streaming
  🏦 charged €15.99
  [↩︎ Reopen](reopen|chg_X)
  — New price saved for the next charges.

